{"ticker":{"symbol":"JBS","name":"JBS N.V.","market":"US","exchange":""},"currency":"USD","price":12.255,"change_pct":-0.011693548387096686,"market_cap":13124013056.0,"pe":17.507143,"pb":1.5768143,"dividend_yield":0.08159934720522236,"week52_low":10.61,"week52_high":18.65,"sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","country":"Netherlands","city":"Amstelveen","employees":283000,"website":"https://jbsglobal.com","business_summary":"JBS N.V., together with its subsidiaries, engages in the processing of animal proteins, encompassing activities related to beef, pork, lamb, and poultry worldwide. The company is involved in the production and marketing of prepared foods and other related products, as well as operations in leather, collagen, hygiene and beauty products, metal packaging, biodiesel, and other related businesses. It offers its products under the Seara, Doriana, Pilgrim's, Moy Park, Primo, Friboi, Maturatta, Swift, Ozo, Adaptable Meals, and other brand names. The company was founded in 1953 and is based in Amstelveen, the Netherlands.","business_summary_ko":"JBS N.V.는 자회사와 함께 전 세계적으로 쇠고기, 돼지고기, 양고기 및 가금류와 관련된 활동을 포함하여 동물성 단백질 가공에 참여하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 가공 식품 및 기타 관련 제품의 생산 및 마케팅뿐만 아니라 가죽, 콜라겐, 위생 및 미용 제품, 금속 포장, 바이오디젤 및 기타 관련 사업에도 참여하고 있습니다. Seara, Doriana, Pilgrim's, Moy Park, Primo, Friboi, Maturatta, Swift, Ozo, Adaptable Meals 및 기타 브랜드 이름으로 제품을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 1953년에 설립되었으며 네덜란드 암스텔베인에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":509542730060.0,"rev_lo":467874991000.0,"rev_hi":522159941020.0,"rev_g":0.1321,"n":13,"eps":5.244,"eps_lo":5.244,"eps_hi":5.244,"eps_g":-0.5391},{"period":"2027","rev":500659033540.0,"rev_lo":468705175000.0,"rev_hi":538856000000.0,"rev_g":-0.0174,"n":15,"eps":6.56733,"eps_lo":3.63,"eps_hi":8.336,"eps_g":0.2524}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"가공식품","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":72613910000.0,"operating_income":4727408000.0,"net_income":2997488000.0,"eps":1.34},{"period":"2023","revenue":729